  "summary": "A lab summary counts the four nucleotide bases in a DNA sample. Return the count for A, C, G, and T and follow the stated behavior for invalid symbols. Report counts of A, C, G and T in a DNA sequence.",
  "durationMinutes": 20,
  "functionName": "countNucleotides",
